    <string name="set_about_got_it">Got it</string>
    <string name="set_about_body">The official Freebuff Android client: talk to an autonomous coding agent and turn ideas straight into code and tasks.
Chats use the real network: official models go through the Freebuff gateway, custom models connect directly to the OpenAI-compatible endpoint you enter;
the Git account is authorized through the GitHub OAuth device flow and can read your repository list.
Chats, settings and custom models live in an on-device database; API keys and Git tokens are encrypted with the Android Keystore.</string>
    <string name="set_about_plan_1">1) a real in-app update flow (download, verify, install);
</string>
    <string name="set_about_plan_2">2) more Git providers, extending to commits and pull requests;
</string>
    <string name="set_about_plan_3">3) subagent orchestration (parallel exploration and parallel edits).</string>
